{"id": "8th-u3-q303", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-12-paadarinthu-ozhuguthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-grammar-seyyulisai-alabedai-metric", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கலித்தொகைப் பாடலில் அமைந்துள்ள 'செறாஅமை', 'மறாஅமை' ஆகிய சொற்களின் மாத்திரை அளவு மற்றும் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "இவை இன்னிசை அளபெடைகள்; அளபெடுத்த 'றாஅ' பகுதி 2 மாத்திரை ஒலிக்கும்", "B": "இவை சொல்லிசை அளபெடைகள்; அளபெடுத்த 'றாஅ' பகுதி 4 மாத்திரை ஒலிக்கும்", "C": "இவை செய்யுளிசை (இசைநிறை) அளபெடைகள்; அளபெடுத்த நெடில்(2) + இனக்குறில்(1) இணைந்து 'றாஅ' 3 மாத்திரை ஒலிக்கும்", "D": "இவை ஒற்றளபெடைகள்; அளபெடுத்த பகுதி 1 மாத்திரை மட்டுமே ஒலிக்கும்"}, "explanation": "செய்யுளில் ஓசை குறையும் போது அதனை நிறைவு செய்ய நெட்டெழுத்து அளபெடுப்பது செய்யுளிசை (இசைநிறை) அளபெடை ஆகும். நெடில் எழுத்து (2 மாத்திரை) தன் இனமான குறிலை (1 மாத்திரை) ஏற்று மொத்தம் 3 மாத்திரையாக ஒலிக்கும். எனவே C சரியானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Determine the metrical duration (Maathirai) and grammatical type of 'SeRaamai' and 'MaRaamai' in Kalithogai:"}], "options": {"A": "Innisai Alabedai; duration is 2 maathirai", "B": "Sollisai Alabedai; duration is 4 maathirai", "C": "Seyyulisai (Isainirai) Alabedai; long vowel (2) + short companion (1) measures 3 maathirai", "D": "Otralabedai; duration is 1 maathirai"}, "explanation": "Seyyulisai Alabedai lengthens a long vowel (2 maathirai) by taking its short companion (1 maathirai), sounding for 3 maathirai in total. Option C is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 48, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "alabedai", "maathirai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q304", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-12-paadarinthu-ozhuguthal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-odd-kalithogai-pair", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கலித்தொகை விளக்கும் நற்பண்பு - விளக்கம் இணைகளில் பொருந்தாத தவறான ஒன்றைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "பண்பு - சான்றோர் காட்டிய வழியில் நடத்தல்", "B": "அறிவு - அறிவற்றவர் கூறும் சொற்களைப் பொறுத்துக் கொள்ளுதல்", "C": "செறிவு - முன்பு சொன்ன வாக்கை மறக்காமல் காப்பாற்றுதல்", "D": "நிறை - குற்றம் செய்தவருக்கு நடுவுநிலையோடு தண்டனை வழங்குதல்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 48: 'நிறை எனப்படுவது மறை பிறர் அறியாமை' (மறைபொருளைப் பிறர் அறியாமல் காப்பது). நடுவுநிலையோடு தண்டனை வழங்குவது 'முறை' (நீதிமுறை) ஆகும். எனவே D பொருந்தாத தவறான பொருத்தமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the incorrectly paired virtue-definition from Kalithogai:"}], "options": {"A": "பண்பு - Following the path of the wise", "B": "அறிவு - Bearing the words of the foolish", "C": "செறிவு - Keeping pledged words unforgotten", "D": "நிறை - Punishing offenders with judicial impartiality"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 48: 'Nirai' means preserving confidentiality ('மறை பிறர் அறியாமை'). Dispensing justice is 'Murai'. Option D is mismatched."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 48, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["odd_one_out", "kalithogai_virtues", "comprehension"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q305", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-13-puthiyai-theettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-quote-agambaavam-fill", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்தமான சொல்லைத் தெரிவு செய்து பாடலடிகளை நிரப்புக:\n\"என் நண்பர் பெரும் புலவராக இருந்தபோதும் ______ இன்றி வாழ்ந்தார்; ஏனெனில் இங்கே இருப்பது சில காலம்.\""}], "options": {"A": "அகம்பாவம்", "B": "சோம்பல்", "C": "வருத்தம்", "D": "வெகுளி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 51 மதிப்பீடு வினா 1: 'என் நண்பர் பெரும் புலவராக இருந்தபோதும் அகம்பாவம் இன்றி வாழ்ந்தார்'. அகம்பாவம் என்றால் செருக்கு என்பது பொருளாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the blank with the appropriate word from the text:\n\"Though my friend was an illustrious scholar, he lived devoid of ______; for our stay here is brief.\""}], "options": {"A": "அகம்பாவம்", "B": "சோம்பல்", "C": "வருத்தம்", "D": "வெகுளி"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 51 evaluation question 1: 'Though my friend was a great scholar, he lived without அகம்பாவம் (arrogance)'. Option A is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educat