{"id": "8th-u3-q330", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-14-palthuraikkalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-grammar-palthurai-compound", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'பல்துறை' என்னும் தொடரின் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "உரிச்சொல் தொடர்", "B": "குறிப்புப் பெயரெச்சத் தொடர் (பலவாகிய துறை)", "C": "வினைத்தொகை", "D": "உம்மைத்தொகை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 52: 'பல்துறை' = பலவாகிய துறை. 'பல' என்பது குறிப்புப் பெயரெச்சமாக நின்று 'துறை' என்னும் பெயர்ச்சொல்லைக் கொண்டு முடிவதால் இது குறிப்புப் பெயரெச்சத் தொடர் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the grammatical attribute (Ilakkana Kurippu) of 'Palthurai':"}], "options": {"A": "Urichchol series", "B": "Kurippu Peyarechcham (Qualitative adjectival participle modifying noun)", "C": "Verbal compound (Vinai thogai)", "D": "Coordinative compound (Ummaith thogai)"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 52: 'Palthurai' expands as 'பலவாகிய துறை', where 'பல' functions as a qualitative adjectival modifier qualifying 'துறை'. Option B is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textb