{"id": "8th-u3-q335", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-14-palthuraikkalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-direct-education-purpose", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அறியாமையை நீக்கி அறிவை விளக்குவது எதுவெனப் பல்துறைக்கல்வி பாடப்பகுதி வரையறுக்கிறது?"}], "options": {"A": "விளக்கு", "B": "விளையாட்டு", "C": "கல்வி", "D": "பாட்டு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 52, 55 மதிப்பீடு வினா 1: 'அறியாமையை நீக்கி அறிவை விளக்குவது கல்வி எனப்படும்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What dispels ignorance and illuminates intellect as defined in the lesson Palthuraikkalvi?"}], "options": {"A": "Lamp", "B": "Sports", "C": "Education", "D": "Song"}, "explanation": "Textbook pages 52, 55 evaluation question 1: Education is defined as that which removes ignorance and enlightens intellect. Option C is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 55, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["direct", "palthuraikkalvi", "definition"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q336", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-14-palthuraikkalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-direct-thiruvika-pseudonym", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மேடைப் பேச்சிலும் இதழியல் உரைநடையிலும் கொடி கட்டிப் பறந்து 'தமிழ்த்தென்றல்' எனப் போற்றப்பட்ட அறிஞர் யார்?"}], "options": {"A": "உ. வே. சாமிநாதையர்", "B": "மறைமலையடிகள்", "C": "தேவநேயப் பாவாணர்", "D": "திரு. வி. கலியாணசுந்தரனார்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 54 நூல் வெளி: திருவாரூர் விருத்தாசலம் கலியாணசுந்தரனார் (திரு.வி.க.) 'தமிழ்த்தென்றல்' என்று அழைக்கப்படுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which illustrious scholar, orator, and essayist was celebrated with the title 'Tamizhthendral'?"}], "options": {"A": "U. Ve. Swaminatha Iyer", "B": "Maraimalai Adigal", "C": "Devaneya Paavaanar", "D": "Thiru. Vi. Kalyanasundaranar"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 54 author note: Thiru. Vi. Kalyanasundaranar is revered throughout Tamil Nadu as 'Tamizhthendral'. Option D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "fu