{"id": "8th-u3-q356", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-aandra-kudipirathal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-grammar-aandra-kudipirathal-breakdown", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஆன்ற குடிப்பிறத்தல்' என்னும் தொடரில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள 'ஆன்ற' மற்றும் 'குடிப்பிறத்தல்' ஆகியவற்றின் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "'ஆன்ற' என்பது வினையெச்சம்; 'குடிப்பிறத்தல்' என்பது பண்புத்தொகை", "B": "'ஆன்ற' என்பது தொழிற்பெயர்; 'குடிப்பிறத்தல்' என்பது வினையெச்சம்", "C": "'ஆன்ற' என்பது எதிர்காலப் பெயரெச்சம்; 'குடிப்பிறத்தல்' என்பது வினைத்தொகை", "D": "'ஆன்ற' என்பது பெயரெச்சம்; 'குடிப்பிறத்தல்' என்பது 'தல்' விகுதி பெற்ற தொழிற்பெயர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 58 குறள் 992: 'ஆன்ற' (ஆன்ற = அமைந்த/நிறைந்த) என்பது 'குடி' என்னும் பெயர்ச்சொல்லைக் கொண்டு முடிவதால் பெயரெச்சம்; 'குடிப்பிறத்தல்' என்பது 'தல்' விகுதி பெற்றுத் தொழிலை உணர்த்துவதால் தொழிற்பெயர் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Determine the grammatical classification (Ilakkana Kurippu) of 'Aandra' and 'Kudipirathal':"}], "options": {"A": "'Aandra' is Vinaiyechcham; 'Kudipirathal' is Panpuththogai", "B": "'Aandra' is Thozhirpeyar; 'Kudipirathal' is Vinaiyechcham", "C": "'Aandra' is Future Participle; 'Kudipirathal' is Vinai thogai", "D": "'Aandra' is Peyarechcham (Adjectival participle); 'Kudipirathal' is Thozhirpeyar (Verbal noun) ending in 'thal'"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 58 kural 992: 'Aandra' qualifies the noun 'kudi' as an adjectival participle (Peyarechcham). 'Kudipirathal' takes the verbal noun suffix 'thal' (Thozhirpeyar). Option D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 58, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "ilakkana_kurippu", "participle_verbal_noun"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q357", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-aandra-kudipirathal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-grammar-thumbaipoo-vetrumai-urubu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தும்பைப்பூப் போல்' என்னும் தொடரில் பயின்று வந்துள்ள வேற்றுமை உருபும் அணியும் யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "'போல்' என்னும் ஐந்தாம் வேற்றுமை ஒப்பு உருபும், உவமையணியும்", "B": "'போல்' என்னும் மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை உருபும், தற்குறிப்பேற்ற அணியும்", "C": "'போல்' என்னும் ஏழாம் வேற்றுமை உருபும், உருவக அணியும்", "D": "'போல்' என்னும் நான்காம் வேற்றுமை உருபும், இல்பொருள் உவமையணியும்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 56: தமிழ் இலக்கணத்தில் ஐந்தாம் வேற்றுமைக்கு 'இல், இன்' என்பனவும், 'போல்' போன்ற ஒப்பு உருபுகளும் உண்டு. 'தும்பைப்பூப் போல வெண்மையான வேட்டி' என்பதில் 'போல்' என்னும் ஒப்பு உருபு வெளிப்படையாக வந்ததால் இது உவமையணியும் ஐந்தாம் வேற்றுமை ஒப்புப் பொருளும் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the case marker and rhetorical figure present in 'Thumbaipoo Pol':"}], "options": {"A": "Fifth case comparative marker 'Pol' and Upamai Ani (Simile)", "B": "Third case marker 'Pol' and Tharkurippetra Ani", "C": "Seventh case marker 'Pol' and Uruvaga Ani (Metaphor)", "D": "Fourth case marker 'Pol' and Ilporul Upamai Ani"}, "explanation": "In Tamil grammar, 'Pol' functions as the comparative marker associated with the fifth case. Explicit comparison of the white dhoti to Thumbai flower exemplifies Upamai Ani. Option A is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "vetrumai", "upamai_ani"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q358", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-aandra-kudipirathal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-grammar-iruvachchaal-punarchi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'இருவாச்சால்' என்னும் சொல்லின் பிரித்தெழுது முறையும் புணர்ச்சி இயல்பும் யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "இரு + சால்; திரிதல் புணர்ச்சி", "B": "இருவா + சால்; இயல்புப் புணர்ச்சியில் சகர ஒற்று மிகுதல் ('இருவாச்சால்')", "C": "இருமை + சால்; ஈறுபோதல் புணர்ச்சி", "D": "இருவர் + சால்; கெடுதல் புணர்ச்சி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 58: 'இருவாச்சால்' = இருவா + சால். ஆகார ஈற்று நிலைமொழியின் முன் சகர வல்லினம் வர 'வல்லினம் மிகல்' விதியால் 'ச்' மிகுந்து 'இருவாச்சால்' என்றானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the morphological split and sandhi property of 'Iruvaachaal'?"}], "options": {"A": "இரு + சால்; Substitution sandhi", "B": "இருவா + சால்; Stop doubling sandhi after long vowel base", "C": "இருமை + சால்; Eerupothal rule", "D": "இருவர் + சால்; Deletion sandhi"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 58: 'Iruvaachaal' decomposes into இருவா + சால். Following the long vowel base, the initial stop 'sa' geminates with 'ch'. Option B is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 58, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "punarchi", "sandhi_splitting"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q359", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-aandra-kudipirathal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-grammar-kural992-metrical-breakdown", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குறள் 992-ன் முதலடியான 'அன்புடைமை ஆன்ற குடிப்பிறத்தல் இவ்விரண்டும்' என்பதில் அமைந்துள்ள சீர்களின் எண்ணிக்கை மற்றும் வெண்பாத் தளையைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "3 சீர்கள் கொண்ட சிந்தடி; ஆசிரியத்தளை", "B": "5 சீர்கள் கொண்ட நெடிலடி; கலித்தளை", "C": "4 சீர்கள் கொண்ட அளவடி; வெண்டளை (இயற்சீர் வெண்டளை / வெண்சீர் வெண்டளை)", "D": "6 சீர்கள் கொண்ட கழிநெடிலடி; வஞ்சித்தளை"}, "explanation": "குறள் வெண்பாவின் முதலடி நான்கு சீர்களைக் கொண்ட அளவடி ஆகும்; இது வெண்பாவிற்குரிய வெண்டளையால் (இயற்சீர் வெண்டளை, வெண்சீர் வெண்டளை) தளைக்கப்படும். எனவே C சரியானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Determine the metrical foot count and prosodic link (Thalai) of the first line of kural 992:"}], "options": {"A": "3 feet Sinthadi; Asiriyathalai", "B": "5 feet Nediladi; Kalithalai", "C": "4 feet Alavadi (Standard tetrameter); Vendhalai (Iyarseer/Venseer Vendhalai)", "D": "6 feet Kazhinediladi; Vanjithalai"}, "explanation": "The opening line of a Kural Venba strictly contains 4 feet (Alavadi) governed by Vendhalai prosody. Option C is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 58, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "prosody", "kural_venba"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q360", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-aandra-kudipirathal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-odd-story-character-mismatch", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஆன்ற குடிபிறத்தல்' கதையின் கதைமாந்தர் - தன்மை இணைகளில் பொருந்தாத தவறான ஒன்றைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "சிகாமணி - வேட்டியை எடுத்து இருவாச்சாலில் ஒளித்து வைத்தவர்", "B": "சகாதேவன் - தந்தையின் தவறைத் திருத்திக் குடும்பப் பழியை நீக்கிய மாணவன்", "C": "கிருஷ்ணமூர்த்தி - சகாதேவன் கொடுத்த வேட்டியை ஆசிரியரிடம் ஒப்படைத்த இளைஞன்", "D": "கதைசொல்லி ஆசிரியர் - சிகாமணி மீது ஊர் நியாயத்தில் 1000 ரூபாய் அபராதம் வாங்கித் தந்தவர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 59: ஆசிரியர் சிகாமணிக்கு அபராதம் பெற்றுத் தரவில்லை; மாறாக 'என் வேட்டி திருடு போகவே இல்லை' என்று கூறி இருவரையும் காப்பாற்றினார். எனவே D தவறான பொருந்தாத இணையாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the mismatched character-attribute pairing from 'Aandra Kudipirathal':"}], "options": {"A": "சிகாமணி - Took the dhoti and hid it inside the Iruvaachaal", "B": "சகாதேவன் - Student who rectified father's flaw and cleared family shame", "C": "கிருஷ்ணமூர்த்தி - Youth who delivered the dhoti given by Sahadevan to the teacher", "D": "கதைசொல்லி ஆசிரியர் - Headmaster who secured a 1000-rupee fine against Sikamani in the panchayat"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 59: The teacher explicitly refused to impose a fine, asserting his dhoti was never stolen. Option D is the mismatched pairing."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["odd_one_out", "character_traits", "narrative"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q361", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-aandra-kudipirathal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-quote-kural-completion-992", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கோடிட்ட இடங்களைச் சரியான சொற்களைக் கொண்டு நிரப்புக:\n\"அன்புடைமை ______ குடிப்பிறத்தல் இவ்விரண்டும்\n______ என்னும் வழக்கு.\""}], "options": {"A": "ஆன்ற, பண்புடைமை", "B": "சான்ற, ஒழுக்கமுடைமை", "C": "ஆன்ற, அடக்கமுடைமை", "D": "மான்ற, பண்புடைமை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 58: 'அன்புடைமை ஆன்ற குடிப்பிறத்தல் இவ்விரண்டும் / பண்புடைமை என்னும் வழக்கு' (குறள் 992). விடுபட்ட சொற்கள்: ஆன்ற, பண்புடைமை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the blanks with the authentic metrical words of kural 992:\n\"Anbudaimai ______ kudipirathal ivvirandum\n______ ennum vazhakku.\""}], "options": {"A": "ஆன்ற, பண்புடைமை", "B": "சான்ற, ஒழுக்கமுடைமை", "C": "ஆன்ற, அடக்கமுடைமை", "D": "மான்ற, பண்புடைமை"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 58: Kural 992 reads 'அன்புடைமை ஆன்ற குடிப்பிறத்தல் இவ்விரண்டும் / பண்புடைமை என்னும் வழக்கு'. The missing words are 'ஆன்ற' and 'பண்புடைமை'. Option A is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 58, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["quote_completion", "kural_feet", "memoriter"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q362", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-14-palthuraikkalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-odd-nature-academy-scholars", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திரு.வி.க. குறிப்பிடும் 'இயற்கைக் கழகத்தில் பயின்ற சங்க மற்றும் பக்திப் புலவர்கள்' பட்டியலில் பொருந்தாத ஒருவர் யார்?"}], "options": {"A": "இளங்கோவடிகள்", "B": "வீரமாமுனிவர்", "C": "திருத்தக்கதேவர்", "D": "ஆண்டாள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 53: இயற்கைக் கழகத்தில் பயின்று பாடியவர்களாகத் திரு.வி.க. குறிப்பிடுபவர்கள்: இளங்கோ, திருத்தக்கதேவர், திருஞானசம்பந்தர், ஆண்டாள், சேக்கிழார், கம்பர், வள்ளலார் ஆகியோர். வீரமாமுனிவர் இப்பட்டியலில் இடம்பெறவில்லை. எனவே B பொருந்தாத ஒன்றாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who among the following was NOT listed by Thiru. Vi. Ka. as a poet-pupil of 'Nature's Academy'?"}], "options": {"A": "Ilango Adigal", "B": "Veeramamunivar", "C": "Thiruthakkadevar", "D": "Andal"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 53: The nature poets listed by Thiru. Vi. Ka. are Ilango, Thiruthakkadevar, Sambandar, Andal, Sekkizhar, Kambar, and Vallalar. Veeramamunivar is not mentioned. Option B is the odd one out."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 53, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["odd_one_out", "nature_poets", "literary_history"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q363", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-14-palthuraikkalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-direct-science-kozhukombu-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "புற உலக ஆராய்ச்சிக்கு 'அறிவியல்' எதனைப் போன்றது எனத் திரு.வி.க. பல்துறைக்கல்வி பகுதியில் உருவகிக்கிறார்?"}], "options": {"A": "ஆழமான ஆணிவேர் போன்றது", "B": "வானளாவிய கோபுரம் போன்றது", "C": "கொழுகொம்பு போன்றது", "D": "கலங்காத கலங்கரை விளக்கம் போன்றது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 54, 55 நிரப்புக வினா 2: 'புற உலக ஆராய்ச்சிக்கு அறிவியல் கொழுகொம்பு போன்றது'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To what object does Thiru. Vi. Ka. liken 'Science' in relation to external empirical research?"}], "options": {"A": "Deep taproot", "B": "Sky-scraping tower", "C": "Supporting trellis / prop (Kozhukombu)", "D": "Unwavering lighthouse"}, "explanation": "Textbook pages 54, 55 fill in the blank question 2: 'Science is like a supporting trellis (கொழுகொம்பு) for investigating the physical universe'. Option C is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 54, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["direct", "palthuraikkalvi", "science_metaphor"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q364", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-aandra-kudipirathal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-direct-kudipirathal-source-book", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பி. ச. குப்புசாமி எழுதிய 'ஆன்ற குடிபிறத்தல்' என்னும் கதை எந்த நூலிலிருந்து எடுத்துத் தொகுக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது?"}], "options": {"A": "ஜெயகாந்தனோடு பல்லாண்டு", "B": "இளமை விருந்து", "C": "தமிழ்ச்சோலை", "D": "ஓர் ஆரம்பப்பள்ளி ஆசிரியனின் குறிப்புகள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 59 நூல் வெளி: 'இவர் எழுதிய ஓர் ஆரம்பப்பள்ளி ஆசிரியனின் குறிப்புகள் என்னும் நூலிலிருந்து ஒரு பகுதி இங்குத் தரப்பட்டுள்ளது'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "From which book by P. S. Kuppusamy was the story 'Aandra Kudipirathal' excerpted?"}], "options": {"A": "Jayakanthanodu Pallaandu", "B": "Ilamai Virunthu", "C": "Tamizhchcholai", "D": "Or Aarambappalli Aasiriyanin Kurippukal"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 59 author note: The lesson is drawn from P. S. Kuppusamy's memoir 'Or Aarambappalli Aasiriyanin Kurippukal'. Option D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services C