{"id": "8th-u3-q385", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-16-vinaimutru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-grammar-iranthakaala-vinaimutru-identify", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்காணும் வினைமுற்றுச் சொற்களுள் இறந்தகாலத்தைத் தெளிவாகக் காட்டும் தெரிநிலை வினைமுற்று எது?"}], "options": {"A": "படித்தான்", "B": "நடக்கிறான்", "C": "உண்பான்", "D": "ஓடாது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 62 மதிப்பீடு வினா 2: 'படித்தான்' = படி + த் + த் + ஆன். இதில் 'த்' இறந்தகால இடைநிலை. நடக்கிறான் (நிகழ்காலம் - கிறு), உண்பான் (எதிர்காலம் - ப்). எனவே 'படித்தான்' இறந்தகால வினைமுற்று ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following finite verbs clearly exhibits past tense (Iranthakaala Therinilai Vinaimutru)?"}], "options": {"A": "படித்தான்", "B": "நடக்கிறான்", "C": "உண்பான்", "D": "ஓடாது"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 62 evaluation question 2: 'Padithaan' carries the past tense infix 'th' (படி + த் + த் + ஆன்). 'Nadakkiraan' is present, 'Unbaan' is future. Option A is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 62, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "tense_identification", "vinaimutru"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u3-q386", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-16-vinaimutru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-grammar-identify-yeval-vinaimutru", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பின்வருவனவற்றுள் முன்னிலை ஒருமை ஏவல் வினைமுற்றுச் சொல் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "செல்க", "B": "ஓடு", "C": "வாழ்க", "D": "வாழிய"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 62 மதிப்பீடு வினா 3: 'ஓடு' என்பது தன்முன் உள்ளவரை ஓடுமாறு கட்டளையிடும் ஏவல் வினைமுற்று ஆகும். செல்க, வாழ்க, வாழிய என்பன வியங்கோள் வினைமுற்றுகள். எனவே B சரியானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following is a second person singular imperative finite verb (Yeval Vinaimutru)?"}], "options": {"A": "செல்க", "B": "ஓடு", "C": "வாழ்க", "D": "வாழிய"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 62 evaluation question 3: 'Odu' is an imperative commanding the listener to run. 'Selga', 'Vaazhga', and 'Vaazhiya' are optative verbs. Option B is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 62, "chapter": null, "section": nul