{"id": "8th-u3-q389", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-16-vinaimutru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-quote-fill-sentence-mutru", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொடரில் உள்ள வினைமுற்றுச் சொல்லைக் கண்டறிந்து வெற்றிடத்தை நிரப்புக:\n\"மாடு வயலில் புல்லை மேய்ந்தது – இத்தொடரில் உள்ள வினைமுற்றுச் சொல் ______ ஆகும்.\""}], "options": {"A": "மேய்ந்தது", "B": "மாடு", "C": "வயலில்", "D": "புல்லை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 62 மதிப்பீடு வினா 1: 'மாடு வயலில் புல்லை மேய்ந்தது' என்பதில் செயல் முற்றுப்பெற்று அமைந்த வினைமுற்றுச் சொல் 'மேய்ந்தது' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify and fill in the finite verb from the sentence:\n\"Maadu vayalil pullai meynthathu - The finite verb in this sentence is ______.\""}], "options": {"A": "மேய்ந்தது", "B": "மாடு", "C": "வயலில்", "D": "புல்லை"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 62 evaluation question 1: The finite verb expressing completed predicate action is 'மேய்ந்தது'. Option A is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year"