{"id": "8th-u3-q392", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-16-vinaimutru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u3-direct-therinilai-factors-count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தெரிநிலை வினைமுற்றில் செயல் நடைபெறுவதற்குரிய கூறுகளாக எத்தனை காரணிகள் வெளிப்படையாக அமைகின்றன?"}], "options": {"A": "மூன்று கூறுகள்", "B": "நான்கு கூறுகள்", "C": "ஐந்து கூறுகள்", "D": "ஆறு கூறுகள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 60: செய்பவர், கருவி, நிலம், செயல், காலம், செய்பொருள் ஆகிய ஆறு கூறுகளும் வெளிப்படுமாறு அமைவது தெரிநிலை வினைமுற்று ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many essential factors (agent, instrument, place, action, tense, object) are explicitly manifested in a Therinilai Vinaimutru?"}], "options": {"A": "3 factors", "B": "4 factors", "C": "5 factors", "D": "6 factors"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 60: Therinilai Vinaimutru overtly reflects all six factors (agent, instrument, locus, action, tense, object). Option D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "202